    "title": "FIRST ALERT WEATHER DAY: Flash flooding, damaging storm threats - NewsBreak",
    "text": "WLUC\nwebsite\nUpper Peninsula Of Michigan, Michigan\nFIRST ALERT WEATHER DAY: Flash flooding, damaging storm threats\nBy Noel Navarro,\n9 hours agoFlash flood and severe/damaging thunderstorm threats increase across Upper Michigan Wednesday, as approaching systems from the Canadian Prairies and Great Plains absorb heat-and-moisture energy sourced in the region. The developing frontal boundary is projected to stall over the U.P., increasing the development of strong to severe storms plus soaking rain events across the region. Severe storms can produce damaging wind plus isolated large hail and tornadoes -- 5% chance along the interior west.",
